{"ID":"20240118144954-zkdacya","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144954-zkdacya","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144954-zkdacya\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144954-0gqxyh2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170422-yfva97m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170422-jyjonh9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:278,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:294\u0026#125;","title":"375补18三七","type":"doc","updated":"20240204164954"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144954-0gqxyh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144954-0gqxyh2","updated":"20240122170411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国湖广一带，山野自生，庭园亦可栽植，茎高二三尺，根作团块。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170412-3vb2y6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170412-3vb2y6q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，微苦，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170414-k8oy4ad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170414-k8oy4ad"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】三七为散瘀定痛要药，功能散一切恶血，保一切新血，治血瘀成肿成痛，外敷能消肿止血。为云南白药之主药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170416-041nnt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170416-041nnt7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】金鱼将死，入山漆叶（三七叶）汁于鱼口，即活，无名疮疖，捻叶敷之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170418-f6yms5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170418-f6yms5g"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【倪注】举凡内外伤，诸烂疮，乳痈等都可以用，镇痛止血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170419-euk0e6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170419-euk0e6n"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通钱半至三钱，大剂一两左右。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170422-lr4yfll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170422-lr4yfll"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170420-pjufcf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170420-pjufcf0"}},{"ID":"20240122170420-v1zx7hl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170420-v1zx7hl"}},{"ID":"20240122170422-jyjonh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170422-jyjonh9","updated":"20240204164954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看这就是三七，三七长这个样子，是很好的伤科的用药。三七，这是三七，那这个三七呢，我们也会使用，在我们中国大陆湖广一带，三七味甘，微苦，性温，无毒。它是散瘀定痛的要药，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三七呢活血化瘀，散一切恶血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们把坏的血清除掉，才会产生新的血，所以也是止痛的药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三七的止痛，大部分都是伤科的止痛。骨折、筋拉伤、脱臼、刀伤、砍伤、车祸的外伤、现在还有枪伤，跟记者扯的拉伤，马脚的踢伤，什么伤都可以，都可以用三七"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个是现在什么受伤都有啊，那最主要是伤科的药。那日本呢，金鱼死掉就赶快给它吃三七叶，鱼就活过来了啊，日本人养那个金鱼。那我们现在用在所有的伤科痛证，象"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳房的痛、臭、化脓都可以使用三七"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，三七非常好用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170422-yfva97m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170422-yfva97m"}}]}